st literatures as well as an important international language of the world. The prose, poetry, novel, drama, short story essay, rhetoric, grammar of Arabic language is highly developed in comparison to other literature. Aims and objectives of teaching and learning of Arabic is to make acquaintance with a great literature and language of the world and to gain proper wisdom to be a complete human beings.\nThe Aims and Objectives of Arabic Department are summarized as follows:\nTo increase the number of students in the department of Arabic as to educate and aware them about different literary issues.\nTo provide the students the knowledge of Arabic language and literature.\nTo provide the students the knowledge of basic principles of Islamic rules and regulations on the basis of Quran and Hadith.\nTo develop socio- religious environment among the students and the in general.\nThe Vision:\nThe Department of Arabic aims to enhance the comprehensive power of the students in Arabic Language and Literature for the overall development of intellectual and linguistic abilities to seek their future internationally.\nThe Mission\n:\nThe Department of Arabic seeks to provide more educational opportunities to the underprivileged and the marginalized section of the society.\nPresent Teaching Staff of the Department\nName\nDate of Joining\nProfessional Qualification\nRuhul Amin Ahmed\n17-07-2002\nNIL\nAbdus Satter\n08-09-2008\nNIL\nSufia Khatun\n05-06-2009\nNIL\nSabina–E-Yasmin\n06-11-2011\nNIL\nFaculty Profile:\nName\nQualification\nDesignation\nWorking Experience\nRuhul Amin Ahmed\nMA (Arabic, Sociology)\nAssistant Professor\n22 YEARS\nAbdus Satter\nMA (Arabic)\nAssistant Professor\n16 YEARS\nSufia Khatun\nMA (Arabic)\nAssistant Professor\n15 YEARS\nSabina E Yasmin\nMA (Arabic)\nAssistant Professor\n13 YEARS\nFaculty Exchange Programme:\nThe faculty exchange programme is a collaborative activity of two educational institutions, united under a Memorandum of Understanding, exchanging the services of their selected faculties for a short period.The primary aim of faculty exchange program is to provide the opportunity for the exchanged personnel to encourage professional development through the stimulus of a different setting and for the host organizations to benefit from the knowledge and skills of the exchanged personnel.\nActivities under Faculty Exchange Program.\nName of the Faculty\nHost Institute\nTopic\nDate\nAbdus Satter\nJuria College\nKatahguri College\nIndo-Arab relations: commercial.\n19/05/23\nDepartmental Seminar/ Workshop Organized:\nYear\nTopic\nFunding Agency\nDate\n2023\nDevelopment of Arabic Language and Literature.\nKatahguri College\n24-05-2023\n2023\nOne Month Certificate Course on Spoken Arabic.\nKatahguri College\n13-06-2023 onwards\nResult of the Students ( Year Wise):\nYear\nCourse/Program\nNo. of the Students Appeared in the Final Year Exam.\nNo. of the Students Pass in the Final Year\nPass Percentage(%)\n2018-19\nHonors\n12\n12\n100%\nRegular\n07\n07\n100%\n2019-20\nHonors\n10\n10\n100%\nRegular\n04\n04\n100%\n2020-21\nHonors\n04\n04\n100%\nRegular\n07\n07\n100%\n2021-22\nHonors\n17+02\n17+02\n100%\nRegular\n11\n11\n100%\nYear\nCourse/Program\nNo. of the Students Appeared in the Final Year Exam\nNo. of the Students Pass in the Final Year\nPass Percentage(%)\n2022-23\nHonors\n100%\nRegular\n07\n07\n100%\nSearch for:\nSIDEBAR MENU\nMission & Vision\nAlumni Association\nAdministrative Body\nPrincipal's Message\nAdmission Procedure\nCollege Uniform\nNOTICE\nEnrollment List\nCollege Prospectus\nOnline Admission Link\nStudent Placement Record\nQUICK LINKS\nGauhati University\nDibrugarh University\nKKHSOU\nIGNOU\nUGC\nDHE Assam\nSWAYAM\nTop\nCopyright  © 2026 Katahguri College -\nUD WEB SOLUTIONS\nHOME\nABOUT US\nDEPARTMENTS\nIQAC\nNAAC\nSTUDENT’S CORNER\nGALLERY\nCONTACT US\nClose\nSearch for:\nMenu\nHOME\nABOUT US\nHISTORY\nVISION & MISSION\nISO CERTIFICATE\nPRINCIPAL DESK\nGOVERNING BODY\nNON-TEACHING STAFF\nALUMNI ASSOCI